===Etymology===
From {{suffix|fi||alt1=pela-|staa}}, with a stem of {{unk|fi}} origin; it is sometimes theorized to derive from {{ncog|gem-pro|*felhaną||to hide, conceal}}, but the semantic development seems unusual. Cognates include {{cog|izh|pelastaa}} and {{cog|krl|pelastoa}}.

